Use flexible sizes for layouts and images, and use media queries to adjust styles for different screen widths. For example:
```css
.container { width: 90%; margin: auto; }
img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .container { width: 100%; }
  nav { display: block; }
}
```
The media query applies the contained styles when the viewport is at most 600 pixels wide.
